/*
 * Palace Fig Garden — south of outside28, east of garden1.
 *
 * Strategy A FluffOS room. Original (TimeMsg, pick fig,
 * sit/romp/search, Phinney NPC) is garden2_ldmud.lpc.
 * Look at fig grove / ripe figs / hedges is flavour.
 * Pick/sit/romp/search and Phinney are not loaded.
 * Archive keeps “big leave”, “perferred”, “figs..”,
 * and “the the ripe”.
 */

